WEBVTT

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.880
Come on, come on, come on!

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.360
We need tires now!
Come on, let's go!

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.120
- No, no, no, no! No tires, just gas!
- [male] What?

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.320
You need tires, you idiot!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.640
[Darrell] Looks like it's
gas-and-go's for McQueen today.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.120
[Bob] Right. No tires again.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.920
[Darrell] That's a short-term gain,
long-term loss,

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:37.640
but it's workin' for him. He obviously
knows somethin' we don't know.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:44.280
[cars whizzing]

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:50.000
[Bob] This is it, Darrell. One lap to go
and Lightning McQueen has a huge lead.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.960
He's got it in the bag.
Call in the dogs and put out the fire!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.280
We're gonna crown us a new champion!

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.560
[crowd cheers and whistles]

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.880
[screaming]

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.000
- Checkered flag, here I come!
- [tire blows]

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.080
[Darrell] No! McQueen's blown a tire!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.880
[Bob] And with only one turn to go!
Can he make it?

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.520
- You fool!
- [grunts]

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.360
[male] McQueen's blown a tire!
He's blown a tire!

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:16.920
Go, go, go!

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.000
- [grunting]
- [tire blows]

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:27.800
[Darrell] He's lost another tire!

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:31.160
- King and Chick come up fast!
- [Bob] They're entering turn three!

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:33.080
Come on. [grunting]

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.160
I don't believe
what I'm watching, Bob!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:40.800
Lightning McQueen
is 100 feet from his Piston Cup!

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.160
[gasping]

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:45.880
[growling]

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.120
[Bob] The King and Chick
rounding turn four.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.240
[Darrell] Down the stretch they come!
And it's, and it's...

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.120
- It's too close to call! Too close!
- I don't believe it!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.560
Lightning!

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.840
- The most spectacular, amazing...
- I don't believe it!

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:06.400
...unequivocally, unbelievable ending
in the history of the world!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.520
- And we don't know who won!
- Look at that!

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.760
[tape jittering]

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.880
[slow motion drone]

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.200
- That's very close to call.
- Can we play that again?

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.480
Hey, no cameras! Get outta here!

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:27.080
We're here in Victory Lane,
awaiting the results. We're here in Victory Lane,
awaiting the results.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.600
McQueen, that was a risky move,
not taking tires.

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:30.720
Tell me about it!

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.400
Are you sorry you didn't have
a crew chief out there?

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:36.920
Oh, Kori. There's a lot more to racing
than just winning.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.880
I mean, taking the race by a full lap...
Where's the entertainment in that?

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.880
I wanted to give folks a little sizzle.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.080
- Sizzle?
- Am I sorry I don't have a crew chief?

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.360
No, I'm not.
'Cause I'm a one-man show.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.840
What? Oh, yeah, right.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.960
That was a confident
Lightning McQueen.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.680
Live from Victory Lane,
I'm Kori Turbowitz.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.440
- Get outta the shot.
- Yo, Chuck.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.240
Chuck, what are you doing?
You're blockin' the camera!

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.280
- Everyone wants to see the bolt.
- What?

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.960
- Now, back away.
- That's it! Come on, guys.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:07.080
- Whoa, team! Where are you going?
- We quit, Mr. One-Man Show!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.880
Oh, OK, leave. Fine.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.720
How will I ever find anyone else
who knows how to fill me up with gas?

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:13.760
[crowd laughs]

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.760
- Adios, Chuck!
- And my name is not Chuck!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.480
Oh, whatever.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.600
Hey, Lightning! Yo! McQueen!

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:23.920
Seriously, that was some
pretty darn nice racin' out there.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.240
- By me!
- Oh, yeah.

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.840
- Zinger!
- Welcome to the Chick era, baby!

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.600
The Piston Cup...
It's mine, dude. It's mine.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:36.240
Hey, fellas, how do you think
I'd look in Dinoco blue? Dinoco blue!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.120
In your dreams, Thunder.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.280
Yeah, right. Thunder?
What's he talkin' about, "Thunder"?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.200
You know, 'cause thunder
always comes after lightning.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.080
Ka-ping! Ka-pow!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.560
- Who knew about the thunder thing?
- I didn't.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.320
- Give us the bolt!
- That's right.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.880
Right in the lens.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.200
- Show me the bolt, baby!
- Smile, McQueen!

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:57.600
- Show me the bolt, McQueen!
- That's it!

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:00.040
[electronic music]

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.800
[crowd chattering]

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:07.360
That was one close finish.
You sure made Dinoco proud.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.440
Thank you, King.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.280
Well, Tex, you've been
good to me all these years.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.680
It's the least I could do.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:16.000
Whatever happens, you're a winner
to me, you old daddy rabbit.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.840
Thanks, dear.
Wouldn't be nothing without you.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.640
Kch-i-ka-chow!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:23.360
- I'm Mia.
- I'm Tia.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:26.680
[both] We're, like, your biggest fans!
Ka-chow!

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:29.280
I love being me.

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:32.440
- [police] OK, girls, that's it.
- We love you, Lightning!

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.320
[chuckles]

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:37.240
Hey, buddy.
You're one gutsy racer.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.880
Oh, hey, Mr. The King.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.760
You got more talent in one lug nut

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.360
than a lot of cars has got
in their whole body.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.040
- Really? Oh, that...
- But you're stupid.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.680
- Excuse me?
- This ain't a one-man deal, kid.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:51.840
You need to wise up and get
a good crew chief and a good team.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.960
You ain't gonna win
unless you got good folks behind you,

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.360
[voice dwindling] and you let them
do their job, like they should.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.160
- Like I tell the boys at the shop...
- A good team.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.120
- Yeah...
- [electronic music]

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.400
Ka-chow! Ka-pow!

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.720
[crowd cheering]

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.360
[screaming]

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.160
[cheering]

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.240
Oh, Lightning!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.480
If you figure that out
you just gonna be OK.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:42.200
Oh, yeah, that...
That is spectacular advice.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.680
Thank you, Mr. The King.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.840
- [fanfare]
- [Bob] Ladies and gentlemen,

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:48.160
for the first time
in Piston Cup history...

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:51.920
[revving] A rookie
has won the Piston Cup.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:53.400
Yes!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.400
[Bob] ...we have a three-way tie.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.280
- [crowd cheers]
- [cameras flash]

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:06.080
[chuckling] Hey,
that must be really embarrassing.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.840
But I wouldn't worry about it.
Because I didn't do it!

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:13.320
[Bob] Piston Cup officials
have determined that a tiebreaker race

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:17.600
between the three leaders
will be held in California in one week.

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:21.120
Well, thank you! Thanks to
all of you out there! Thank you!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.880
[whispering] Hey, first one to
California gets Dinoco all to himself.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:27.960
No, not me!
No, you rock, and you know that!

